    slug: "health-insurance-guide-india-2026",
    title: "Best Health Insurance Plans in India 2026: How to Choose the Right Policy",
    excerpt:
      "A practical guide to choosing health insurance in India — what to look for in sum insured, co-pay, room rent limits, network hospitals, and whether a family floater makes sense for you.",
    category: "Personal Finance",
    readMinutes: 8,
